Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 15:39:38 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 32/41] MTROPOLIS: Implement Hoologic Save Bitmap and Import
 Bitmap

Uncle Albert's Fabulous Voyage saves each photo with Save Bitmap under a
path like "<player>/photo1/photo3" and loads it back with Import Bitmap
into the photo that goes in the notebook. Both modifiers were stubs, so
every photo stayed blank.

Save Bitmap writes the bitmap as a BMP file in the save folder, named
after the game target and the path, and Import Bitmap reads it back.
Each modifier has a bitmap variable and a variable with the path; which
is which is told apart by type. Their two booleans are still unknown.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
